&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingSharesAndBondsEtcOfUnconsolidatedSubsidiariesAndAssociatesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DebtorsNotesRegardingOverdraftContractsAndOrLoanCommitmentsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２. 当社グループにおいては、運転資金の効率的な調達を行うため取引銀行５行と当座貸越契約を締結しておりま&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　す。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;  当連結会計年度末における当座貸越契約に係る借入未実行残高等は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:446.4pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:153.8pt;min-width:153.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:123.8pt;min-width:123.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:22.5pt;min-width:22.5pt;"/&gt;
